---
// Service blueprint: Posting and browsing — frontstage/backstage/support layers
---

<div class="visual-diagram blueprint-diagram" role="img" aria-label="Service blueprint: posting and browsing. Sarah, the seller, photographs the couch, confirms the title and sets a price, confirms how pickup works, and posts. Marcus, the buyer, opens the app, browses the map or the list and opens the couch listing. Backstage: title and category suggestion, Content Moderation, Trust Inference Engine, Neighborhood Graph Service and Notification Service. Support: Geolocation API, street network graph, housing density data, photo storage and CDN, push notification service, search index, organizer guidelines and prohibited items policy.">
  <div class="visual-label">Service Blueprint: Posting and browsing</div>

  <!-- Frontstage: Seller -->
  <div class="blueprint-lane">
    <div class="blueprint-lane-label">
      <span class="blueprint-lane-title">Frontstage</span>
      <span class="blueprint-lane-sub">Sarah, seller, moving this week. Steps 1 to 4 take under 30 seconds [brief]. The couch has to be gone within 4 to 48 hours.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="blueprint-lane-nodes">
      <div class="blueprint-node">
        <div class="blueprint-node-step">1</div>
        <div class="blueprint-node-label">Photographs the couch or picks a photo</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-connector"></div>
      <div class="blueprint-node">
        <div class="blueprint-node-step">2</div>
        <div class="blueprint-node-label">Confirms or edits the title, then sets a price or marks the couch free</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-connector"></div>
      <div class="blueprint-node">
        <div class="blueprint-node-step">3</div>
        <div class="blueprint-node-label">Confirms how pickup works: porch, meet outside or flexible</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-connector"></div>
      <div class="blueprint-node">
        <div class="blueprint-node-step">4 ◆</div>
        <div class="blueprint-node-label">Posts</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="blueprint-line-of-interaction">
    <span>Line of interaction</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Frontstage: Buyer -->
  <div class="blueprint-lane">
    <div class="blueprint-lane-label">
      <span class="blueprint-lane-title">Frontstage</span>
      <span class="blueprint-lane-sub">Marcus, buyer, walking home. Opening the app to pickup takes him 20 minutes to 2 hours.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="blueprint-lane-nodes">
      <div class="blueprint-node">
        <div class="blueprint-node-step">5 ◆</div>
        <div class="blueprint-node-label">Opens the app and browses the map or the list</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-connector"></div>
      <div class="blueprint-node blueprint-node-end">
        <div class="blueprint-node-step">6</div>
        <div class="blueprint-node-label">Opens the couch listing</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="blueprint-line-of-visibility">
    <span>Line of visibility</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Backstage -->
  <div class="blueprint-lane blueprint-lane-backstage">
    <div class="blueprint-lane-label">
      <span class="blueprint-lane-title">Backstage</span>
    </div>
    <div class="blueprint-lane-nodes blueprint-lane-services">
      <div class="blueprint-service">
        <div class="blueprint-service-name">Title and category suggestion</div>
        <div class="blueprint-service-detail">Step 1. Suggests a title and category from the photo.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-service">
        <div class="blueprint-service-name">Content Moderation, automated layer</div>
        <div class="blueprint-service-detail">Step 4. Classifies the photo and text. Holds prohibited items (weapons, drugs, regulated goods) for review, detects duplicate listings, and flags price anomalies during a declared emergency.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-service">
        <div class="blueprint-service-name">Trust Inference Engine</div>
        <div class="blueprint-service-detail">Step 4. Limits a new account to 3 active listings until its first completed exchange. Step 6. Supplies Sarah's trust signals.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-service">
        <div class="blueprint-service-name">Neighborhood Graph Service</div>
        <div class="blueprint-service-detail">Steps 4 and 5. Computes each person's walking radius and returns the listings inside Marcus's.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-service">
        <div class="blueprint-service-name">Notification Service</div>
        <div class="blueprint-service-detail">Sends each person a daily digest of the 3 to 5 newest items closest to them.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="blueprint-line-of-support">
    <span>Line of support</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Support -->
  <div class="blueprint-lane blueprint-lane-support">
    <div class="blueprint-lane-label">
      <span class="blueprint-lane-title">Support</span>
    </div>
    <div class="blueprint-lane-nodes blueprint-lane-services">
      <div class="blueprint-service blueprint-service-infra">
        <div class="blueprint-service-name">Geolocation API</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-service blueprint-service-infra">
        <div class="blueprint-service-name">Street network graph</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-service blueprint-service-infra">
        <div class="blueprint-service-name">Housing density data</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-service blueprint-service-infra">
        <div class="blueprint-service-name">Photo storage and CDN</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-service blueprint-service-infra">
        <div class="blueprint-service-name">Push notification service</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-service blueprint-service-infra">
        <div class="blueprint-service-name">Search index</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-service blueprint-service-infra">
        <div class="blueprint-service-name">Organizer guidelines</div>
      </div>
      <div class="blueprint-service blueprint-service-infra">
        <div class="blueprint-service-name">Prohibited items policy</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
